# PROJECT: PHANTOM AI — THE GHOST IN YOUR MACHINE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI engineer, UI/UX designer, open-source developer, and technical product architect.

Build a complete, responsive, production-oriented web application named:

PHANTOM AI
Tagline: "Something is thinking inside your machine."

The project is being created for the DEV Community theme "Ghost in the Machine."

The website must demonstrate how open-weight AI can power a creative, spooky, interactive experience while highlighting model transparency, privacy, local inference, accessibility, and user control.

This must be a functional application, not a static mockup.

Do not stop after producing the homepage. Implement the complete application, connect its features, handle errors, provide setup instructions, and ensure that the project can be run and deployed.

